# UI

- Drawer and side panel share `src/ui/BlockerTreePanel.tsx`. Prefer changes there over forking layouts.
- Content script injects `panel.css` into the shadow root (`?inline`). Launcher-only styles stay in `src/content/content.css`.
- Color mode: `src/ui/useColorMode.ts`. Match Jira lozenges via `PriorityLozenge` rather than inventing new status colors.
- Keep the header **Blockers** button resilient to Jira re-renders (`observeHeader` / `ensureLauncherSlot`).
- TypeScript + React 19 function components. No new UI libraries unless asked.
